From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Neogram Patchset <patches@neogram.invalid>
Subject: hooks/chat-message-menu: extension points of the chat message menu

ChatActivity.fillMessageMenu ends with NeoMessageMenu.fill, which may add Neogram items
(ids from 1000, far from the stock OPTION_* values) or remove stock ones;
processSelectedOption gets a default branch that hands unknown ids to
NeoMessageMenu.onSelected before the stock cleanup. neo_runOption runs a stock option for
a message without the menu (double tap), and forwardMessages is public so features can
forward with the stock slow-mode and thread handling. Shared by the message menu extras,
double tap and the translator.
---
 TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/ChatActivity.java | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/ChatActivity.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/ChatActivity.java
index 0000000..0000000 100644
